    "## Overview\n",
    "This notebook finds the best tradeoffs between detection coverage, meaning catching the real attacks and daily SOC Analyst labor cost, using alert threshold and analysts for each shift as the decision variables. Finding the best balance for finding real alerts and SOC Analysts availability."
   ]
  },
